+                        <p id="description">The RS medium is a fully defined medium designed for growing diverse marine protists. RS medium presents a natural buffer system with a pH of ~7 and a salinity of 3,3%. It includes two components: the Non-Nutrient Medium (NNM) and the Nutrient Medium 1.0 (NM 1.0). Here we show the preparation of the NNM.</p>
