ucts & Projects Services Central Home ▸ Shop All Products ▸ Cell Culture Media, Supplements, and Reagents ▸ Cell Culture Reagents, Antibiotics and Supplements ▸ Nutritional Supplements ▸ Bacto™ Casitone Gibco™ Bacto™ Casitone Bacto Casitone is an animal origin (AO) pancreatic enzymatic digest of casein similar to Difco Casein Digest. While this supplement Read more Have Questions? Change view Catalog Number Quantity 225930 500 g 225910 10 kg 2 Options Catalog number 225930 Price (USD) 238.00 Each Add to cart Quantity: 500 g Price (USD) 238.00 Each Add to cart Bacto Casitone is an animal origin (AO) pancreatic enzymatic digest of casein similar to Difco Casein Digest. While this supplement provides a nutritional profile based on casein, the specific enzymatic digest performed for this product results in a particularly high content of amino acids and peptides of varying sizes, making it a more nutritious hydrolysate. Customers have successfully used this supplement for the production of Escherichia coli-based recombinant proteins. Specifications Certifications/Compliance ISO/DIS, 11014 For Use With (Application) Production of Escherichia coli-based recombinant proteins Format Bottle Product Line Bacto Quantity 500 g Shelf Life 1825 Days Source Animal origin, casein Form Powder Product Type Dehydrated Culture Media Unit Size Each Contents & Storage Storage conditions: 2°C to 25°C. Store in cool, dry conditions in well-sealed containers. Frequently asked questions (FAQs) What alternative product do you recommend for Bacto Tryptone (Cat. No. 211699, 211701, 211705)? We have several casein digests that could serve as alternatives to Bactone Tryptone (Cat. No. 211699, 211791, 211705), including Bacto Casitone (Cat. No. 225930, 225910), Difco Tryptone Peptone (Cat. No. 21921, 211922, 211923), BiTek Tryptone (Cat. No. 251420). However, the digestion and nutritive profile of each peptone are different, therefore there may be differences in bacterial growth or supplementation 